# Complete, version-predetermined Windows x64 / CPython 3.11 client input.
# requirements.txt contains the application's exact direct pins.  Every active
# transitive dependency for that target is pinned below as well, so the release
# workflow cannot select a newer compatible package at build time.  Any package
# update must revalidate and update this entire closure before building a new
# offline wheelhouse and SHA-256-hashed requirements-client.lock.
-r requirements.txt

